    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Pacific Islands Port Leaders Visit, through Global Marketing &amp; Communications, Inc.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) brings port sector officials from the Pacific Islands, including Papua New Guinea, Fiji, Solomon Islands, and Samoa, to the United States to familiarize them with state-of-the-art U.S. technologies, services, and best practices to improve port operations, security, and sustainability.</narrative>
